    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Average playtime:</strong> around 120 minutes.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beneath the Bell</strong> is a horror game that combines exploration, bizarre puzzles, and frightening paranormal phenomena, all enriched by brief action sessions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will find yourself in an old abandoned school, immersed in a gloomy and disturbing atmosphere, which changes and deforms due to paranormal events that you will unintentionally trigger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383710/extras/9b717de14c49a6b65ad74daf4adf848f.poster.avif?t=1741599493\" width=640 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383710/extras/9b717de14c49a6b65ad74daf4adf848f.webm?t=1741599493\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383710/extras/9b717de14c49a6b65ad74daf4adf848f.mp4?t=1741599493\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By exploring it thoroughly, it will reveal itself to you, allowing you to uncover its secrets and move forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will have to solve dark puzzles and escape the presences that haunt the school.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383710/extras/4323a621bf4fa53ae5853fd9660ea579.poster.avif?t=1741599493\" width=640 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383710/extras/4323a621bf4fa53ae5853fd9660ea579.webm?t=1741599493\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383710/extras/4323a621bf4fa53ae5853fd9660ea579.mp4?t=1741599493\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive atmosphere</strong>: explore a dark and eerie school full of disturbing elements..</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaging story:</strong> Discover the tragic events that marked the school desks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Paranormal:</strong> Watch the school change right before your eyes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzles:</strong> Solve puzzles that are not too complex but definitely bizarre.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration:</strong> Search every corner of the school to uncover its secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Action:</strong> Survive the presences.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And then there's this guy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383710/extras/dbdfd30ebc3807e9dcc0c911b8d08d14.poster.avif?t=1741599493\" width=640 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383710/extras/dbdfd30ebc3807e9dcc0c911b8d08d14.webm?t=1741599493\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383710/extras/dbdfd30ebc3807e9dcc0c911b8d08d14.mp4?t=1741599493\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
